---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>This blog is my notebook, kept in public</h1>
			<p>
				Hi, I'm <strong>Locch</strong>. My mind keeps generating things — questions, ideas,
				half-formed arguments — and I write them down before I forget them. That is the whole
				reason this blog exists.
			</p>
			<p>
				Writing gives each thought a version I can return to. When I look back, I can see
				where my earlier thinking was incomplete or wrong, question it again, and improve it.
				This blog is not only a record of what I thought; it is a record of how my thinking
				changes.
			</p>
			<p>
				That is why I love writing here: <strong>I am allowed to be wrong.</strong> A post
				doesn't have to be the final, perfect answer. It can be the best version of my
				thinking today, waiting for a better version tomorrow.
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>If you don't treat your ideas well, they stop coming.</strong> An idea you
				write down, question, and finish invites the next one. An idea you ignore quietly
				leaves.
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>I don't believe success arrives instantly.</strong> It is built through
				consistent daily work and the slow accumulation of experience.
			</p>
			<p>
				No schedule, no niche — mostly AI, software engineering, and how we learn.
				If a post is useful to you too, that's a bonus.
			</p>
			<p>Start anywhere:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="/blogs/blog/">The posts</a></li>
				<li><a href="/blogs/about/">Who I am</a></li>
			</ul>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
